{"4190070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ladies, Don’t Tempt My Immortality", "steam_appid": 4190070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4206960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is the Global Version of “美女，请别影响我成仙”.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players worldwide, with ongoing updates and support. Learn more about this version in the <i>Steam Discussion board</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say the path to immortality is paved with hardship. But in your case, this hardship happened to take the form of seven dangerously beautiful women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Lin Fan, the chosen one of the Crane Illusion Sect. Born with a Pure Yang Lineage, you are destined to ascend to the heavens. However, no matter how hard you train, fate sends yet another challenge in your way...temptations in the shape of an unreliable master, a strict senior sister, or a saintess who seems far more interested in testing your heart rather than your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the thousand tribulations of love, jealousy, and thunder? Or will your heart fall just before your heavenly ascension?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Calamities on Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jing Wuyu:</strong> <strong>The Mischievous Immortal</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Little disciple, come closer… there are benefits here.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic yet caring, her unorthodox lessons often come with a steep price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/a121c92a03aa1edbbd0a3bf8a96b7348.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/a121c92a03aa1edbbd0a3bf8a96b7348.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lan Yunrou: The Martial Mistress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Practice hard? The scabbard will serve you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant, severe, and secretly protective... but mercy isn’t part of her training plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/3a8ad2f68a4769b89d85c8d9981836c0.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/3a8ad2f68a4769b89d85c8d9981836c0.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bai Wanwan: The Foxy Seductress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Junior Brother… whose scent is this on you?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every smile is temptation, every look a tribulation. Determined to tempt you from your destiny, her past unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/11a9ffe665c29015b9648f8ae4022e87.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/11a9ffe665c29015b9648f8ae4022e87.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lei Xiao: The Lightning Immortal</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lin Fan, ready for another shock?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable, dangerous, and literally shocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/93ae7272e599793d4609ceb96ba888bb.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/93ae7272e599793d4609ceb96ba888bb.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wenren Lanke: The Innocent Troublemaker</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lin Fan! You’re going to explode again!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweet appearance hides the undisputed problem-child of the Sect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/f31d9a6bd4567004d48e45f71433103e.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/f31d9a6bd4567004d48e45f71433103e.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yin Ping’er: The Poisoned Tea Saintess</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Brother Lin Fan, does it still hurt after I stabbed you?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft voice, poisonous charm... a beauty you'll never see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/77674619dcdd0a2c3d70e77a7356a1fa.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/77674619dcdd0a2c3d70e77a7356a1fa.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pan Suqin: The Gentle Soul</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stay… Sister will make you soup.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warmest embrace hides the sharpest knife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/89933c724ce95726083fc422a412eb8a.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/89933c724ce95726083fc422a412eb8a.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Cinematic Live-Action FMV Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning xianxia-inspired effects bring a mythic Chinese fantasy world to life. Feel the spark of every lightning strike!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A First-Person Immortal Ascension Adventure</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the robes of Lin Fan and experience the world through his eyes. Every glance, every touch, and every whispered word can shake your Dao heart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Paths, Infinite Outcomes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you walk the merciless path of the true immortal, or lose yourself in mortal passion? Every choice leads to a different fate: enlightenment, downfall, or something in between.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train, Duel, and Survive Heavenly Tribulation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-time trials, emotional duels, and comedic chaos await. Survive your master's &quot;training,&quot; dodge objects thrown at you, and protect your Divine Essence… at all costs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Tips for Aspiring Immortals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Never believe your master... especially when she says, &quot;This time, I won’t deceive you.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Senior sisters strike fast... but jealousy strikes faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Your Divine Essence is both a blessing and a curse... manage it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive live-action FMV experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese myth-inspired fantasy setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and branching choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor, romance, and supernatural chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thunder, temptation, and transcendence</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is the Global Version of “美女，请别影响我成仙”.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players worldwide, with ongoing updates and support. Learn more about this version in the <i>Steam Discussion board</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say the path to immortality is paved with hardship. But in your case, this hardship happened to take the form of seven dangerously beautiful women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Lin Fan, the chosen one of the Crane Illusion Sect. Born with a Pure Yang Lineage, you are destined to ascend to the heavens. However, no matter how hard you train, fate sends yet another challenge in your way...temptations in the shape of an unreliable master, a strict senior sister, or a saintess who seems far more interested in testing your heart rather than your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the thousand tribulations of love, jealousy, and thunder? Or will your heart fall just before your heavenly ascension?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Calamities on Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jing Wuyu:</strong> <strong>The Mischievous Immortal</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Little disciple, come closer… there are benefits here.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic yet caring, her unorthodox lessons often come with a steep price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/a121c92a03aa1edbbd0a3bf8a96b7348.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/a121c92a03aa1edbbd0a3bf8a96b7348.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lan Yunrou: The Martial Mistress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Practice hard? The scabbard will serve you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant, severe, and secretly protective... but mercy isn’t part of her training plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/3a8ad2f68a4769b89d85c8d9981836c0.poster.avif?t=1775192542\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190070/extras/3a8ad2f68a4769b89d85c8d9981836c0.webm?t=1775192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=